import{_ as i,o as n,c as t,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 312 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Eliminate Dark Turmoil","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 312 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Eliminate Dark Turmoil","no":312,"module":2,"tags":["Shrouding the Heavens","Alaya Supervision","Dark Turmoil","Institutional Design","Prevention Mechanism"],"related":["21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principle","27-Anchor Calibration and Maintenance","57-Dark Replacement Body Origin and Essence"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0312_模块2-遮天-阿赖耶监管方案.md","filePath":"en/0312_模块2-遮天-阿赖耶监管方案.md"}'),o={name:"en/0312_模块2-遮天-阿赖耶监管方案.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,d,h){return n(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-312-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-alaya-supervision-plan-institutional-design-to-eliminate-dark-turmoil" tabindex="-1">Entry 312 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Eliminate Dark Turmoil <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-312-shrouding-the-heavens-decomposition-alaya-supervision-plan-institutional-design-to-eliminate-dark-turmoil" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 312 | Shrouding-the-Heavens Decomposition | Alaya Supervision Plan: Institutional Design to Eliminate Dark Turmoil&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Shrouding-the-Heavens System (Entry 25) | Benchmark base: Documents 21, 27, 57</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-turmoil-is-not-natural-disaster-but-an-engineering-problem-that-can-be-early-warned" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Turmoil is not natural disaster, but an engineering problem that can be early-warned <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-turmoil-is-not-natural-disaster-but-an-engineering-problem-that-can-be-early-warned" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Turmoil is not natural disaster, but an engineering problem that can be early-warned&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the collective ascension axiom requires strong ones to feed back; the causal self-discipline axiom requires rooting out civilization regression. This entry targets Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; most painful dark turmoil (see Entry 296), giving the Alaya Network supervision&#39;s concrete institutional design — downgrading turmoil from &quot;periodic disaster&quot; to &quot;early-warnable, intervenable engineering event.&quot; The law-first axiom requires: supervision design must be operable, not mystical talk. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = medium (oligarchic civilization). The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Post-turmoil energy waste (harvesting billions, civilization reconstruction from zero) is pre-eliminated under Alaya supervision: anomalous activity is intervened on detection, avoiding harvest. This is &quot;prevention&quot;&#39;s energy advantage over &quot;post-disaster relief.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Turmoil&#39;s three triggers — ancient supremes&#39; lifespan anxiety, forbidden-land beings awakening, strong-one imbalance — under Alaya supervision correspond to three early warnings:</p><ol><li>Ancient supremes&#39; lifespan curve → life-circulation system replacement, cutting harvesting motivation</li><li>Forbidden-land energy anomalies → whole-network monitoring, anomaly = early warning</li><li>Strong-one power imbalance → Anchor calibration, preventing single-pole expansion</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Ye Fan&#39;s way of suppressing turmoil is &quot;I come and fight,&quot; essentially treating turmoil as a conflict to be solved with force. Alaya supervision treats turmoil as an engineering problem to be solved with data — not relying on Ye Fan&#39;s fists, but on system reaction speed. This itself is a negation of the &quot;strong ones solve everything&quot; predatory thinking.</p><p>Alaya supervision must also solve an ethical problem: who watches the watchers? Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer is Anchor Supervision Committee + Symbiotic Court double review, and Alaya data transparent to Myriad Ranks — any monitoring record is searchable by Myriad Ranks, any intervention decision can be appealed. This fundamentally contrasts with Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; &quot;emperor = rules, no one can question&quot; structure. Supervision is not a new dictatorship, but dismantling dictatorial power into reviewable, appealable, replaceable procedures. If Ye Fan is to accept Alaya supervision, he must first accept: every suppression he makes will be recorded, reviewed, examined by Myriad Ranks — he is no longer an unquestionable god.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Shrouding Turmoil Response</th><th>Alaya Supervision Plan</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Emperor seated in suppression</td><td>Whole-network monitoring + automatic early warning</td></tr><tr><td>Only fights after turmoil erupts</td><td>Intervenes at turmoil&#39;s sprout</td></tr><tr><td>Relies on Ye Fan&#39;s personal judgment</td><td>Anchor Council + Symbiotic Court decision</td></tr><tr><td>Ancient supremes harvest lives to extend</td><td>Life-circulation system public replacement</td></tr><tr><td>Turmoil is world-view iron law</td><td>Turmoil is an engineering-preventable event</td></tr><tr><td>Post-disaster relief</td><td>Pre-event prevention</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate ten dark turmoils in Shrouding-the-Heavens&#39; history</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: inject Alaya supervision system, retro-simulate whether each turmoil could have been early-warned</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: early-warning lead time, intervention success rate, avoided population loss</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: conclusion — of ten turmoils, nine can be snuffed at the sprout, one needs emperor-level assistance; Myriad-Rank population loss drops over 90%</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Supervision plan self-consistency</strong>: high — Alaya Network already validated in Heng Yuan Zhou operation</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk</strong>: zero — supervision rules clear</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: drops from medium to low — turmoil no longer depends on Ye Fan personally suppressing</li></ul><p>Alaya supervision must also prevent &quot;supervision itself becoming new darkness.&quot; If Alaya data is monopolized by one party, supervisors become new emperors. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s design is data transparent to Myriad Ranks, intervention decisions appealable, Supervision Committee independent of Executive Committee. These three safeguards ensure Alaya is Myriad Ranks&#39; tool, not a new ruler. If Ye Fan accepts Alaya supervision, he also accepts: he is no longer the cosmos&#39; sole arbiter; every intervention he makes will be examined by Myriad Ranks.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: upgrade &quot;post-disaster relief&quot; to &quot;pre-event prevention,&quot; avoiding billions being harvested</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: cut off ancient supremes&#39; &quot;harvest lives to extend&quot; predatory path</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo has no such design; this plan is a direct alternative to oligarchic order</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: supervision protects all Myriad-Rank beings, no human/demon distinction</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: supervision system can replicate cross-plane</li></ul><p>Alaya supervision also needs paired &quot;threshold&quot; design: what level of strong-one anomaly needs early warning, what level needs intervention, what level needs Symbiotic Court ruling. Shrouding-the-Heavens world has no such threshold, so emperors either do nothing or personally strike. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s tiered-response mechanism matches supervision cost to risk level.</p><ul><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dark turmoil is not Shrouding-the-Heavens world&#39;s &quot;fate,&quot; but the result of it not installing an early-warning system. Ye Fan can fight ten turmoils; Alaya can make the eleventh turmoil never happen.</p><p>Alaya supervision&#39;s last safeguard is &quot;Myriad Ranks search right&quot;: any monitoring record is public to Myriad Ranks, any intervention decision can be questioned. This ensures supervision is not a new dictatorship, but the extension of Myriad Ranks&#39; collective will. If Ye Fan accepts Alaya, what he accepts is not being watched, but being trusted as a member of Myriad Ranks.</p><p>In the final analysis, Shrouding-the-Heavens · Alaya supervision plan described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./296_模块2-遮天-黑暗动乱解析.html">Entry 296 · Dark Turmoil Analysis</a> · <a href="./308_模块2-遮天-锚点共生替代方案.html">Entry 308 · Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principle</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const m=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
